{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》今（23日）假啟德體藝館隆重舉行，當中有7強選手尹景順、許美琪、蔡宓婕、尤淑情、許雲妮、吳亦偉以及鄭家聲（排名不分先後）華麗登場。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">決賽前夕，率先舉行紅地氈，出席人士包括TVB行政主席許濤JP、文化體育及旅遊局局長羅淑佩，一眾TVB藝人包括魔音女團「MYNT」成員宋宛穎、莊子璇、倪樂琳、倪嘉雯、盧映彤、喬美莎，中一、中二以及中三一班師兄師姐以及星級評審巫啟賢聯同五大評審肥媽、周國豐、張佳添、海兒及谷婭溦等，現場星光熠熠。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"01f048be-3d12-4f8f-a020-7966bf8c.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ppiLU576mg1787478869.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"01f048be-3d12-4f8f-a020-7966bf8c.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0a36c489-bc4a-439c-acf5-dc523329.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026DqlOuhYdMR1787478935.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; 